            </note>
            <note corresp="#d408-f4" n="4" xml:id="d408-f4-content">
                <p>André François-Poncet, French Ambassador in Germany.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d408-f5" n="5" xml:id="d408-f5-content">
                <p>General Disarmament Conference; for correspondence, see <ref target="#pg1">pp.
                        1</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
